<title>USA: New York City MAC sets annual meeting on Sept 30.</title>
<headline>New York City MAC sets annual meeting on Sept 30.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Municipal Assistance Corp (MAC) for New York City said on Friday that it plans to hold its annual meeting on September 30 at 1000 EDT.</p>
<p>The MAC was set up in the mid-1970s to handle the city's debt crisis.</p>
<p>--Joan Gralla, 212-859-1654</p>
